afade audio filter (src/audio/afade.ts)

src/audio/afade.ts adapts the afade filter of FFmpeg libavfilter/af_afade.c:
the afade option table (type/t, start_sample/ss, nb_samples/ns, start_time/st,
duration/d, curve/c, silence, unity) and its positional order, init's range
check, config_output's duration/start_time rescaling at the link rate,
fade_gain for the TRI, QUA, CUB, SQU, PAR, IPAR, DESI, QUAT and NONE curves,
filter_frame's cur_sample mapping and branch selection (the unity==1
pass-through, av_samples_set_silence or scale_samples with the silence gain,
scale_samples with the unity gain, fade_samples), the FADE/SCALE sample loops
with C truncation for integer formats, and the sample_fmts list.

